<title>USA: AmeriResource CEO to convert common shares.</title>
<headline>AmeriResource CEO to convert common shares.</headline>
<dateline>LENEXA, Kan. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>AmeriResources Technologies Inc said Monday its president, Delamr Janovec, has agreed to exchange 30 million shares of the construction and consulting firm's common stock for preferred stock in the company's Tomahawk Construction Co unit.</p>
<p>The move reduces AmeriResource's outstanding shares by about 20 percent.</p>
<p>Janovec will receive preferred stock that will entitle him to 51 percent voting control of Tomahawk, AmeriResource said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
